.TH ORO-INTERNAL-PLATFORM-REQUEST 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:internal/platform\-request \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:internal/platform\-request'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:internal/platform\-request is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBplatformRequest(feature, action, options, signal)\fR
Runs a bounded document\-owned Android operation and cancels its native work when the caller aborts. Native deadlines also release callers that disappear.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIfeature\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIaction\fR (string; required)
.br
\fIoptions\fR (object; required)
.br
\fIsignal\fR (AbortSignal; optional)
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIPromise<any>\fR
